.superpowers/brainstorm/**/server-info

# The project file is generated, but Package.resolved must be tracked: it is what
# pins the MLX and swift-transformers versions, and a build machine that cannot
# run the resolver (Xcode Cloud) fails with "a resolved file is required". The
# whole project directory is ignored, so this one file has to be pulled back in.
!Haiity.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved
